CORE
main.go
--go-race-check --unwind 1 --unwinding-assertions
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[go::main\.main\.panic\.1\] line 32 panic: unreachable: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
unwinding assertion.*: FAILURE
^warning: ignoring
--
A loop `for c { body }` whose iterations that continue it write nothing
(an atomic load, or a failing compare-and-swap, and a body of
runtime.Gosched or time.Sleep calls) is converted to at most one such
iteration followed by an assumption that c is false.
